mosfet_op: the operating point of an NMOS and a PMOS (sp_mos1, SPICE level 1) with resistor loads: the model family converts without a sweep
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
load "spice/mos1.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
model nmod sp_mos1 vto=0.7 kp=100u lambda=0.02
model pmod sp_mos1 type=-1.0 vto=-0.7 kp=50u lambda=0.02
vdd (vdd 0) vsource dc=3.0
vg (g 0) vsource dc=1.5
rn (vdd dn) resistor r=10k
m1 (dn g 0 0) nmod w=10u l=2u
rp (dp 0) resistor r=10k
m2 (dp g vdd vdd) pmod w=20u l=2u
control
  analysis op1 op
endc
